{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14141","headline":"闻顔尚书陷贼中 · 戎昱","name":"闻顔尚书陷贼中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻说征南没，那堪故吏闻。\n能持苏武节，不受马超勳。\n国破无家信，天秋有鴈羣。\n同荣不同辱，今日负将军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}